'''Narnia'''
# A fictional land in which a series of seven children’s books, ''The Chronicles of Narnia'' by [[w:C. S. Lewis|C. S. Lewis]] are set.
# The movie Lion, The Witch and, The Wardrobe is based on the the book in the Narnia series The Lion, The Witch and, The Wardrobe.

